<title>USA: Coca-Cola Co Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Co Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.39		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			967,000		  802,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,656,000		4,895,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     2,492,000		2,518,000</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.09		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net		    2,730,000		2,338,000</p>
<p> Revs		  14,103,000	     14,685,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     2,497,000		2,531,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Share data reflects 2-for-1 split in May 1996.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net includes after tax gains of $320 million on a U.S. tax settlement adn $190 million on issuance of equity in units.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net also reduced about $200 million after taxes by reduction of concentrate inventories held by bottlers and charge of $55 million in connection with project infinity.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
